# `folder`

In [`std/io/fs`](index.hmd).

```hql
fn folder(path: String) : Folder
fn folder(path: Path) : Folder
```

The `Folder` at `path`, a `String` or a `Path`. Constructing it opens
nothing; a relative path resolves as a file's does.
<!-- hql reference: end -->
